  "prompt": "Generate original pixel artwork for Orange Pets full-screen core-shader HUD. A 256x256 GUI texture to be displayed as a 900x480 landscape panel in Minecraft. Warm dark cocoa/chocolate nearly solid spacious interior with subtle very sparse texture, orange citrus bevel border 4px, tiny blocky paw motifs only in outer corners, vanilla Minecraft pixel aesthetic. Leave entire inner area clear for dynamic text, animal previews and clickable controls. No text, no letters, no inventory slots, no grid, no icons in the interior, no baked pets. Transparent outside rounded/stepped corners. Keep texture commands economical. This is the actual final art generation, not a mockup.",
